b/1/1a/Portrait_Tomboldt_the_Pallid.png/25px-Portrait_Tomboldt_the_Pallid.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Portrait_Tomboldt_the_Pallid.png/38px-Portrait_Tomboldt_the_Pallid.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Portrait_Tomboldt_the_Pallid.png/50px-Portrait_Tomboldt_the_Pallid.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tomboldt the Pallid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Portrait_Tomboldt_the_Pallid.png/25px-Portrait_Tomboldt_the_Pallid.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1a/Portrait_Tomboldt_the_Pallid.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tomboldt_the_Pallid\" title=\"Tomboldt the Pallid\">Tomboldt the Pallid</a> inside <a href=\"/wiki/Felogyr%27s_Fireworks\" title=\"Felogyr's Fireworks\">Felogyr's Fireworks</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Installation of self-destruction element in the <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Throne\" title=\"Iron Throne\">Iron Throne</a> was successful.\n</p><p><br>\nUsed majority of explosives ordered.\n</p><p><br>\nNo questions asked, none answered.\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Gortash</a> will be pleased.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202852\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1595/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26102/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6297/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936149/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,templa